ava&amp;Lenovo&amp;LG&amp;M_and_A&amp;MouseComputer_Co_Ltd&amp;Mustek&amp;M=
edion&amp;Multilaser&amp;NEC&amp;Newline&amp;Nexian&amp;NComputing&amp;OLPC=
